1
00:00:01,084 --> 00:00:03,418
As Uke comes to strike the side of your head

2
00:00:03,419 --> 00:00:05,673
step in deeply raising both arms

3
00:00:05,674 --> 00:00:08,081
bringing the strike around
in a big circular movement.

4
00:00:08,582 --> 00:00:09,845
Controlling his wrist

5
00:00:10,346 --> 00:00:12,809
step in deeply to his rear
and cut down.

6
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:14,758
As Uke comes round

7
00:00:14,759 --> 00:00:16,925
control his wrist and turn sharply

8
00:00:17,026 --> 00:00:20,333
while maintaining the control
come around to his front

9
00:00:20,334 --> 00:00:22,218
turn Uke´s body over in front of you.

10
00:00:22,519 --> 00:00:23,674
Sit down

11
00:00:24,075 --> 00:00:26,372
placing his shoulder in between the knees

12
00:00:26,373 --> 00:00:28,105
controlling his arm and wrist,

13
00:00:28,106 --> 00:00:29,692
holding him close against your body

14
00:00:30,093 --> 00:00:33,570
turn your body towards his head for the pin.

